cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Outbreak Signal Service"
abstract: >-
  Spring Boot service that pulls weekly surveillance data from DHIS2, flags
  statistical aberrations with EARS and CUSUM methods, and publishes the
  resulting signals as a REST API, signed webhooks and FHIR DetectedIssue
  resources. Signals are for human review, not confirmed outbreaks.
authors:
  - name: "Khalilur Rahman Ridoy"
    alias: "khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/outbreak-signal-service"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
keywords:
  - disease surveillance
  - outbreak detection
  - DHIS2
  - FHIR
  - Spring Boot
